## Conditional Panels {.smaller}

::: columns
::: column
![Screenshot of the inputs without a conditional panel](images/without-conditional-panel.png){height = 80%}
![Screenshot of the inputs with a conditional panel](images/with-conditional-panel.png)
:::
::: column
- Showing a color picker before it is needed could confuse app users   
- `conditionalPanel(condition, ...)` allows us to encapsulate elements of the UI and only show them when `condition` is fulfilled  
- Here, a condition of `condition = 'input.submit > 0'` is true when the submit button was pressed at least once.  
- This is implemented in `03c_submission.R`
:::
